    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "body": "After looking through the code, I guess we would need a new `complex32_bf16` type (similar to `CUDA_C_16BF`) to handle this. Either that or we keep converting between `float16` and `bfloat16`, which would probably destroy any advantage gained from `bfloat16`. As even `complex32` seems to not be completely supported, I'm not sure what the chances are `bfloat16` support will arrive soon.",
